{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2005-reserva-4","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2005,"convocatoria":"Reserva 4","documento":"MAT-2005-RESERVA_4.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2005-reserva-4-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{5x+8}{x^2+x+1}\\).","apartados":["(0,5 p.) Calcula los puntos de corte de la gráfica de \\(f\\) con los ejes coordenados.","(0,5 p.) Halla las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).","(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\) y calcula sus extremos relativos o locales (puntos en los que se obtienen y valores que alcanza la función).","(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(x=0\\): \\(f(0)=8\\). Con \\(y=0\\): \\(5x+8=0\\iff x=-\\frac85\\).</p><div class='res'>Corta a los ejes en \\((0,8)\\) y \\(\\left(-\\frac85,0\\right)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x^2+x+1\\gt0\\) siempre (discriminante \\(1-4\\lt0\\)): no hay verticales. \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{5x+8}{x^2+x+1}=0\\): horizontal \\(y=0\\), y por tanto no hay oblicuas.</p><div class='res'>Asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{5(x^2+x+1)-(5x+8)(2x+1)}{(x^2+x+1)^2}=\\frac{-5x^2-16x-3}{(x^2+x+1)^2}=\\frac{-(5x+1)(x+3)}{(x^2+x+1)^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=-3},\\ \\boxed{x=-\\frac15}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−3</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1/5</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−4) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1) &gt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,-3)\\) y \\(\\left(-\\frac15,+\\infty\\right)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\(\\left(-3,-\\frac15\\right)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Mínimo en \\(x=-3\\): \\(f(-3)=\\frac{-7}7=-1\\). Máximo en \\(x=-\\frac15\\): \\(f\\left(-\\frac15\\right)=\\frac7{21/25}=\\frac{25}3\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,-3)\\cup\\left(-\\frac15,+\\infty\\right)\\), crece en \\(\\left(-3,-\\frac15\\right)\\). Mínimo relativo \\((-3,-1)\\); máximo relativo \\(\\left(-\\frac15,\\frac{25}3\\right)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado d","html":"<div class='ex'><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,176.6 21.3,176.7 22.6,176.7 23.9,176.8 25.2,176.9 26.5,176.9 27.8,177.0 29.1,177.1 30.4,177.1 31.7,177.2 33.0,177.3 34.3,177.3 35.6,177.4 36.9,177.5 38.2,177.5 39.5,177.6 40.8,177.7 42.1,177.7 43.4,177.8 44.7,177.9 46.0,178.0 47.3,178.1 48.6,178.1 49.9,178.2 51.2,178.3 52.5,178.4 53.8,178.5 55.1,178.6 56.4,178.6 57.7,178.7 59.0,178.8 60.3,178.9 61.6,179.0 62.9,179.1 64.2,179.2 65.5,179.3 66.8,179.4 68.1,179.5 69.4,179.6 70.7,179.7 72.0,179.8 73.3,179.9 74.6,180.0 75.9,180.1 77.2,180.2 78.5,180.4 79.8,180.5 81.1,180.6 82.4,180.7 83.7,180.8 85.0,180.9 86.3,181.1 87.6,181.2 88.9,181.3 90.2,181.5 91.5,181.6 92.8,181.7 94.1,181.8 95.4,182.0 96.7,182.1 98.0,182.2 99.3,182.4 100.6,182.5 101.9,182.7 103.2,182.8 104.5,182.9 105.8,183.1 107.1,183.2 108.4,183.3 109.7,183.4 111.0,183.6 112.3,183.7 113.6,183.8 114.9,183.9 116.2,184.0 117.5,184.1 118.8,184.2 120.1,184.3 121.4,184.3 122.7,184.3 124.0,184.3 125.3,184.3 126.6,184.3 127.9,184.2 129.2,184.1 130.5,183.9 131.8,183.7 133.1,183.4 134.4,183.1 135.7,182.6 137.0,182.0 138.3,181.4 139.6,180.5 140.9,179.5 142.2,178.3 143.5,176.8 144.8,175.1 146.1,173.0 147.4,170.6 148.7,167.7 150.0,164.2 151.3,160.2 152.6,155.4 153.9,149.9 155.2,143.5 156.5,136.1 157.8,127.8 159.1,118.6 160.4,108.5 161.7,97.8 163.0,86.8 164.3,76.0 165.6,65.7 166.9,56.6 168.2,49.1 169.5,43.5 170.8,39.9 172.1,38.4 173.4,38.6 174.7,40.5 176.0,43.5 177.3,47.4 178.6,51.9 179.9,56.7 181.2,61.7 182.5,66.7 183.8,71.6 185.1,76.3 186.4,80.9 187.7,85.1 189.0,89.2 190.3,93.0 191.6,96.5 192.9,99.8 194